From bcead40ce61474aa136190baee9ff338e0d7075b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 02:30:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add multi-account support and a skin wishlist

- Connect several Riot accounts and switch between them from the header;
  expired sessions can be reconnected, accounts persist in localStorage
- API client now takes the session token per call instead of a global token
- Wishlist of skins (localStorage): heart toggle on shop/bundle skins,
  highlight + banner when a wishlisted skin is in the active shop
- Wishlist page: skin search and per-account availability (daily + bundle)
- Backend: GET /api/store/skins/search, riot_id on login/session,
  skin_uuid and tier info on bundle items, tests for search and bundles
- Fix blank /shop page when no session is stored

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
